A||||7||fogglethorpe||just some thoughts...||||1||
Z||000000||fogglethorpe||09-15-2001||05:03 PM||||In the wake of Tuesday's events, and their aftermath, many of us have been introduced to thoughts and emotions that have been  long dormant in us, or indeed  have never existed before. Fierce anger, piercing shock, unspeakable sadness, an overwhelming sense of helplessness as we watch the pictures on tv...these have all come to call.<BR>I have come to believe that holding onto righteous anger  is the right thing to do. We must not let go of it until the blood of our fellow citizens has been avenged with savage finality.<BR>However, we must also remember that the enemy is out there...foreigners who can't  understand  and refuse to embrace liberty and rule of law, as we have. They are insane with hatred, and bent on our demise. They are the real enemy.<BR>That's why I say, we've got to be careful with each other. After seeing what transpired this week, some things seem alot less important than they once did. The loud neighbors, the driver of the car who goes slow in front of us when we are in a hurry, the telemarketer who calls during dinner time...they are not the enemy, just imperfect people who happen to be our brothers and sisters. We all love our country, and work to make a living, and worry about our kids. Our strength will be in our unity, and it is encouraging to see it blossoming this week. <BR>Truly, it is amazing how the worst traits of a few can bring out the best traits in others. Those in Manhattan's ruins who are working tirelessly are an example.<BR>So, in the coming days, let's give each other the benefit of the doubt; put a quarter in someone's empty parking meter, tip your waiter or waitress an extra ten percent, say hello to a passing stranger. Let's kiss our spouses more, embrace our children tighter still, and be there for each other. <BR>We are the greatest and most blessed nation in the history of the world. Let's remember who we are.||||reg||1
Z||000001||hugh||09-15-2001||05:26 PM||||Very well said son!!!||||reg||1
